WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.876
[UPBEAT ELECTRONIC MUSIC] Hey!

00:00:01.876 --> 00:00:02.814
Hey!

00:00:02.814 --> 00:00:05.628
Hey! (SINGING) Oh-oh-oh.

00:00:05.628 --> 00:00:07.390
Woo! (RAPPING) Real
funny, ha-ha-ha.

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:09.460
Uh, well, well, well.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:12.700
Remember all these crazy people
thought that we would fail?

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.672
They said we would be broke,
wouldn't get no clientele.

00:00:15.672 --> 00:00:18.910
And now they see we did it and
you know it gives them hell

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:22.370
when we pull up in a Mase-rati.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.710
Pull up in a new Bu-gatti.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:29.010
This is special,
you can feel it.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.159
They can see it, we just did it.

00:00:38.464 --> 00:00:41.860
This is special,
you can feel it.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.770
They can see it, we just did it.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.920
We did it!

